flowchart TB
  Skill["NEW: order-coffee skill<br/>Published as an MCP resource"] --> Menu["Read current menu + options"]
  Menu --> Cart["Read cart, then edit items"]
  Cart --> Prepare["prepare_cart_checkout<br/>Returns summary + checkoutSessionId"]
  Prepare --> Confirm{"Customer confirms<br/>items and total?"}
  Confirm -->|No / changed cart| Cart
  Confirm -->|Yes| Checkout["checkout_cart<br/>Pass prepared checkoutSessionId"]
  Checkout --> Result{"Response known?"}
  Result -->|Yes| Report["Report returned order ID + status"]
  Result -->|No| Inspect["Inspect checkout session + orders<br/>before another attempt"]
  Note["Skill = assistant guidance<br/>Server still enforces authorization<br/>Staff actions require staff authority"]
